        <details>
          <summary>Is our guest data private?</summary>
          <p>Your RSVP list and guest media are never sold or used outside your wedding. Home addresses stay off the public page. Your project agreement defines the included media allowance, and you receive a full export before scheduled deletion—90 days after the wedding by default.</p>
